{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c79e9b6530a86284","name":"Crew Quality","source":{"id":"source:reference-c79e9b6530a86284","title":"Crew Quality","revision":18068,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:32:25Z","sha256":"2436649fcd0008750dca28c6208740e59cf7146781a490fcccc232fe9eab3af2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18068","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Crew%20Quality&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c79e9b6530a86284","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Rather than providing statistics for every member of a Vehicle's crew, most Vehicle descriptions provide a general \"Crew Quality\" descriptor. The following chart lists the five levels of Crew Quality for GM-controlled ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," crews, along with the appropriate check modifiers.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Use the number in the Attack Bonus column to for all attack rolls performed by the crew. Use the number in the Check Modifier column for all skill checks related to the operation of the vessel (including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks). Crew Quality modifiers a Vehicle's Challenge Level (CL), as shown in the CL Modifier column. These modifiers are already included in the Vehicle's statistics.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CREW QUALITY\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ATTACK BONUS\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHECK MODIFIER\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CL MODIFIER\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Untrained\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Normal\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+0\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Skilled\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Expert\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+2\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Ace\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+12\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+4\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["For unique ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," where the crew's statistics are included, this table is unnecessary. All crewmembers of a general Crew Quality are considered to only have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," levels.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Starship Maneuvers"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Though generic crews aboard Starships do not come with any stock ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"},", Gamemasters who allow the use of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"}," system may wish to allow generic crews to make use of some maneuvers in combat. Use the guidelines below to determine the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"}," (of any type) available to a generic crew. If a given Vehicle has any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"}," not operated by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},", it may also gain additional [",{"tag":"i","children":["Gunner"]},"] maneuvers (given in parentheses):\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Untrained or Normal Crew Quality:"]}," None"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Skilled Crew Quality:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},", 1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuver"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuver"}," (+1 [",{"tag":"i","children":["Gunner"]},"] maneuver)"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Expert Crew Quality:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},", 2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"}," (+2 [",{"tag":"i","children":["Gunner"]},"] maneuvers)"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ace Crew Quality:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},", 4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"}," (+4 [",{"tag":"i","children":["Gunner"]},"] maneuvers)"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The table below lists some of the most common ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"}," for Starships that fulfill certain roles. When a Gamemaster wishes to add the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"}," system to a generic Starship's repertoire, they need only consult the table below, determine the relevant maneuvers for that Starship's role, and then choose a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"}," from that list based on the Crew's Quality.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["STARSHIP ROLE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SUGGESTED MANEUVERS\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["GUNNER MANEUVERS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Bomber\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Angle Deflector Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Angle_Deflector_Shields","referenceId":"reference:438b0255a92258fb"}]},", ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Pattern Delta"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Pattern_Delta","referenceId":"reference:6fa920ff189c0f3c"}]},", ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasive Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasive_